# The tunnel helper every 30 s: the inbox once more, a clock that has become right (wg0 waits for a time not before the
# build), the unit's handshake that proves its link, a firewall reload that took the camera table, a district peer that
# has gone silent. Started by urban-prepare for a junction unit and a district server (the root is read-only, so it
# cannot be "enabled"). The run itself is urban-wg.service.
[Unit]
Description=URBAN OS: keep the tunnel in line with the applied message

[Timer]
OnActiveSec=5s
OnUnitActiveSec=30s
AccuracySec=1s
Unit=urban-wg.service
